10 REM GRAPHICS INPUT EXAMPLE
20 MODE 640 : SCREEN : PAPER 0 : CLG
30 BIGFONT TRANSPARENT : INK 14
40 LOCATE 2,2 : GPRINT "GRAPHICS INPUT"
50 INK 7
60 LOCATE 4,8 : GPRINT "Enter your details below:"
70 PAPER 2 : INK 1 : LOCATE 4,11 : GINPUT "Name: ",NAME$
80 LOCATE 4,14 : GINPUT "Age: ",AGE
90 PAPER 0 : INK 10
100 LOCATE 4,18 : GPRINT "Hello, ";NAME$;"!"
110 LOCATE 4,20 : GPRINT "You are";AGE;"years old."
120 INK 7 : LOCATE 4,24 : GPRINT "Press any key to finish."
130 FRAME
140 PAUSE
150 SCREEN CLOSE
